Provenance of the training data: this checkpoint was trained on GigaSpeech 2,
which its publishers release under Apache-2.0. That corpus is built from
publicly available YouTube audio, so the licence we rely on is the publisher's
grant over the packaged corpus rather than a clean-room recording campaign.
Stated here rather than left implicit, because it is the kind of thing a reader
of a reproduction package should be able to find without asking.

Note: the earlier 30M Vietnamese checkpoint used during development was
CC-BY-NC-ND-4.0 and is not shipped or redistributed; no derived artifacts of it
are included in this repository.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Fetching
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The artifacts above are intentionally not committed to this repository.

  - Opus-MT weights + SentencePiece tokenizers ....... make models
  - FLEURS test parquets (vi_vn, en_us) .............. make data
  - Eval manifest built from those parquets .......... make bench-data

All fetches are pinned to the revisions and SHA-256 digests recorded in
`assets.lock.toml`. The FLEURS validation fixture under `tests/fixtures/` is not
redistributed and is not currently used by the test suite.

If you redistribute any fetched artifact, you must carry the license terms and
attribution recorded above.
